Z||000000||Daleford||01-21-2001||10:08 AM||||I am considering taking a bodykit to Daytona or Carlisle to sell. Who is in the know, & can give me ideas on asking prices||||reg||5
Z||000001||rogergarrison||01-21-2001||12:02 PM||||you will have lots of competition. People at Carlisle will be looking for deals, not manufacturer prices. Like someone who started a kit and got in over their head. I wouldnt pay over 1/2 or so of listed prices, but others might. Accessories like wheels, etc would sell for retail or slightly less.||||reg||1
